  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 30-layer planar dielectric stack on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Layer sequence: HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), alternating, starting with HfO2 at the air side, ending with SiO2 (Lemarchand) at the substrate side (30 layers total). Materials: hfo2 and SiO2 (Lemarchand) from the material catalog. Wavelength bands: 400-700 nm (maximize reflectance) and 1530-1565 nm (maximize transmittance). Design variables: individual thickness for each of the 30 layers. Optimization: gradient_thickness optimizer with step size reduced by 40% from round 1 baseline. Manufacturing constraint: total layer count exactly 30. Incidence angle: 0 degrees (normal incidence, assumed from problem context). Polarization: unpolarized or both TE/TM averaged. Continue from round 1 best candidate thicknesses as initial point.",
